  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to **200°C/180°C fan-forced**. Finely grate the **Parmesan cheese**. Finely chop the **brown onion**. Slice the stalks off the **field mushrooms** and finely chop (leave the mushroom cups whole). Peel and crush the **garlic**.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/59de7965a5ed197da8480f02/step-0e08ee81.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the **egg**, **milk**, **Philadelphia cream cheese** and **3/4** of the **Parmesan cheese**. Season with a **pinch** of **salt** and **pepper** and whisk together with a fork. Set aside.\n• Heat a medium frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the **sunflower seeds** and toast, stirring, for **3-4 minutes**, or until golden. Remove from the pan and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/59de7965a5ed197da8480f02/step-e62ac725.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return the same pan to the heat and add a **drizzle** of **olive oil**. Add the **brown onion** and chopped **mushroom stalks** and cook for **5 minutes**, or until softened. Add the **garlic** and **1/2** of the **dried oregano** and cook for **1-2 minutes**, or until fragrant. Add the **tomato paste**, **warm water (check ingredients list for the amount)**, **brown sugar** and **salt (use suggested amount)**. Season to taste with a **pinch** of **pepper** and mix well. Remove from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/59de7965a5ed197da8480f02/step-65a91678.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange the **mushrooms cups** bottom-side-up on the oven tray lined with baking paper. Spoon the **cheese filling** into each mushroom and top with the **tomato sauce** and the **remaining Parmesan cheese**. Place the mushrooms in the oven to bake for **20-25 minutes**, or until the cheese is golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/59de7965a5ed197da8480f02/step-542bdfef.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a second medium bowl, combine the **remaining dried oregano**, a **drizzle** of **olive oil** and the **white wine vinegar**. Season with a **pinch** of salt and pepper and mix well. Add the **mixed salad leaves** and the toasted **sunflower seeds** and toss to coat. **TIP:** Dress the salad just before serving to avoid soggy leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/59de7965a5ed197da8480f02/step-fc2bcc79.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the lasagne stuffed field mushrooms and the salad between plates.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/59de7965a5ed197da8480f02/step-b7262b44.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
